                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='The business mainly depends on individual consumers, but there is also significant potential to grow in the Corporate and Home Office segments.' captured-sheet='Sales According to the segments' id='4' />
                  <story-point caption='Phones and Chairs emerge as top sales drivers across all categories.' captured-sheet='Bar Chart' id='6'>
