                    </capturedDeltas>
                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='New York City and Los Angeles generate the largest sales volume across the portfolio. Markets in the West Coast (Los Angeles, San Francisco, Seattle) show strong collective revenue compared to Midwest and Southern hubs like Chicago, Columbus, and Houston.' captured-sheet='Cities against its Sum of Sales' id='8' />
                  <story-point caption='High Repeat Order Rate Across 793 Unique Customers&quot;&#10;With 793 total customers generating 9,800 orders, each customer averages approximately 12.3 orders, highlighting strong customer loyalty and lifetime value.' captured-sheet='Total No. of Customers KPI' id='10' />
                  <story-point caption='​&quot;Broad Geographic Base Supporting High-Volume Demand&quot;&#10;Spanning 49 states, the business successfully leverages broad market access to serve 793 customers across 9,800 transaction records.' captured-sheet='States count' id='12' />
